The way this app talks to the STIHL iMOW® cloud is based on the unofficial
Python library "stihl-imow-webapi" by Christian Heinrichs (ChrisHaPunkt),
https://github.com/ChrisHaPunkt/stihl-imow-webapi, released under the MIT License, and for the MY iMOW® app on the unofficial
Home Assistant integration "ha-imow-v2" by simontims,
https://github.com/simontims/ha-imow-v2, released under the MIT License.

iMOW® and STIHL® are trademarks of ANDREAS STIHL AG & Co. KG. This app is not
